{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"stone_scatter","model_identifier":"stone_scatter","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# stone_scatter\n\nLoose grey stones lying in grass, about 1.6 m across, low to the ground (pick-up node).\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -29..28, y 0..6, z -23..25 units (1.62 x 0.17 x 1.35 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 32 x 64, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 24.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 58 x 6 x 48 (w x h x d), centred at x -0, z 1\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `full` (visible by default): stones to gather\n- `depleted`: a few small stones left\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `hit` | 0.3 | once | short shake when struck |\n"},"resolution":{"width":32,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"stone0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-25.0,0.0,-14.0],"to":[-15.0,5.0,-6.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,36.0,10.0,41.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[10.0,36.0,18.0,41.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,36.0,10.0,41.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[10.0,36.0,18.0,41.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,10.0,10.0,18.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,10.0,10.0,18.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"47364362-9c92-5588-b8a7-c8300b00b493"},{"name":"stone0_d","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-23.3333,0.0,-12.6667],"to":[-16.6667,3.0,-7.3333],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north