":"full","type":"bone","keyframes":[{"channel":"position","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"b48029dc-3f51-5fdd-876b-37bf148cbcab","time":0,"color":-1,"interpolation":"linear"},{"channel":"position","data_points":[{"x":1.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.4}],"uuid":"76089d00-1f76-5f50-89d2-43ac09ae442e","time":0.04,"color":-1,"interpolation":"linear"},{"channel":"position","data_points":[{"x":-0.8,"y":0.0,"z":-0.32}],"uuid":"42f219ac-455c-566d-b197-b02befbcd3a0","time":0.1,"color":-1,"interpolation":"linear"},{"channel":"position","data_points":[{"x":0.4,"y":0.0,"z":0.16}],"uuid":"b304429e-4eeb-5719-b04e-dc70bec6d286","time":0.18,"color":-1,"interpolation":"linear"},{"channel":"position","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"0ad1245b-740a-5c54-ac72-4453fbfced3e","time":0.3,"color":-1,"interpolation":"linear"}]},"ae053571-844c-5055-b6d4-fff5d0ee7ee7":{"name":"depleted","type":"bone","keyframes":[{"channel":"position","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"908183f2-7d50-5345-a630-0acbbe00435d","time":0,"color":-1,"interpolation":"linear"},{"channel":"position","data_points":[{"x":1.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.4}],"uuid":"9e7533ef-b147-530a-870e-d9ee6502e674","time":0.04,"color":-1,"interpolation":"linear"},{"channel":"position","data_points":[{"x":-0.8,"y":0.0,"z":-0.32}],"uuid":"64f81ae4-664c-51c0-b332-f75ccd0a570e","time":0.1,"color":-1,"interpolation":"linear"},{"channel":"position","data_points":[{"x":0.4,"y":0.0,"z":0.16}],"uuid":"5900d9f7-ec8e-5e8e-8f9a-7853ffb4991a","time":0.18,"color":-1,"interpolation":"linear"},{"channel":"position","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"a51c8e34-8b35-5dc5-9634-7b0cbca6a0c0","time":0.3,"color":-1,"interpolation":"linear"}]}}}],"description":"# stone_scatter\n\nLoose grey stones lying in grass, about 1.6 m across, low to the ground (pick-up node).\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -29..28, y 0..6, z -23..25 units (1.62 x 0.17 x 1.35 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 32 x 64, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 24.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 58 x 6 x 48 (w x h x d), centred at x -0, z 1\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `full` (visible by default): stones to gather\n- `depleted`: a few small stones left\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `hit` | 0.3 | once | short shake when struck |\n"}